@startuml
title TurbineH - Resolver revisión anual de un cliente

actor Administrador as Admin
participant "Cliente" as Cliente
participant "Suscripción" as Suscripcion
participant "RevisionAnual" as Revision

Admin -> Cliente: consultarCliente()
Cliente --> Admin: cliente
Admin -> Suscripcion: consultar revisiones (acuerdos)
Suscripcion --> Admin: revisionAnual
Admin -> Revision: resolver(actor = Admin, motivo)
@enduml
